## Engineering hierarchical porous ternary Co-Mn-Cu-S nanodisk arrays for ultra-high-capacity hybrid supercapacitors
Wuquan Ye a, Pengcheng Ye a, Haiyan Wang a,∗, Fang Chen b, Yijun Zhong a, Yong Hu a,b,∗
a Key Laboratory of the Ministry of Education for Advanced Catalysis Materials, Department of Chemistry, Zhejiang Normal University, Jinhua 321004, China b Hangzhou Institute of Advanced Studies, Zhejiang Normal University, Hangzhou 311231, China
